なんでだろそばにいたいんだ
I wonder why, I want to be by your side.

24
00:02:17,077 --> 00:02:19,507
キミと一緒なら時計100倍速！
When I'm with you, time moves 100 times faster!

25
00:02:19,507 --> 00:02:21,807
楽しいな 楽しすぎるんだ さすが最強Friend!
It's so fun, way too fun! The ultimate friend!

26
